s://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/mumbai_staticmap.webp)\n\n## Similar Projects\n\n## More Projects in the Kandivali West Area\n\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/caret-right-bold.svg)","images":[]},{"url":"https://blox.xyz/projects/neelyog-aashiyana","title":"Neelyog Aashiyana In Kandivali West | Buy 1 & 2 BHK in Mumbai","raw_content":"![Blox Logo](/assets/images/blox-logo-white.svg)\n\n![user-primary](/assets/icons/user-primary.svg)\n\n![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\nDiscover. Experience. Buy.\n\nGet Personalized experience\n\nby logging in\n\nLogin / Register\n\n[Properties in Mumbai](/buy/mumbai/1a256)\n\n>\n\n[Properties in Kandivali West](/buy/mumbai/kandivali-west-1a256b7a71)\n\n>\n\nNeelyog Group\n\n>\n\n![share-primary](/assets/icons/share-primary.svg)\n\n![compare-inactive-secondary](/assets/icons/compare-inactive-secondary.svg)\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/neelyog-group-neelyog-aashiyana-bedroom-1673941310.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/neelyog-group-neelyog-aashiyana-bedroom-1673941433.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/neelyog-group-neelyog-aashiyana-bedroom-1673941476.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/neelyog-group-neelyog-aashiyana-bedroom-1673941499.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/neelyog-group-neelyog-aashiyana-kids-play-area-1750655552.jpg)VIEW ALL\n\n![Propert-Icon](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/120522061017-NewProject(25).png)\n\n# Neelyog Aashiyana\n\nNeelyog Aashiyana, Sunder Pada, Tank Lane, Kandivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400067\n\nKandivali West\n\n₹73.5 L - 1.34 Cr\n\n₹73.5 L - 1.34 Cr\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n[Price & Floor Plan](#Price & Floor Plan)\n\n![video-primary](/assets/icons/video-primary.svg)\n\n![call-rm](/assets/icons/call-rm.svg)\n\n![calendar-primary](/assets/icons/calendar-primary.svg)\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n## Overview\n\nNeelyog Aashiyana is a thoughtfully planned residential project located in the peaceful locale of Kandivali, Mumbai. As an extension of the original Neelyog Aashiyana development, it continues the mission of creating slum-free and inclusive urban living spaces. The project offers compact 1 & 2 BHK apartments. Designed to provide affordability without compromising on quality, it stands as a symbol of community-focused redevelopment. Its strategic location ensures access to key infrastructure, while offering a serene and well-connected lifestyle.\n\n1 BHK, 2 BHK\n\nReady to move\n\nCompleted in Dec 2018\n\nAvg. Price\n\n₹19,600/sq.ft\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\n375 - 683 sqft\n\nWhy consider buying this property?\n\n* Kandivali Station of the Mumbai Suburban Railway network connects to railways.\n* The Mumbai Metro has a dedicated metro station, Dahanukarwadi.\n* Kandivali West is surrounded by social infrastructure such as banks, schools, and parks.\n\n* The Western Express Highway, S V Road, and Link Road connect to the local.\n* Kandivali West is about 18 kilometers from Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport.\n\n## Google AI Summary\n\n✦\n\nSummary of Online Reviews Overall Impression: The project is generally perceived as a well-connected residential tower that offers modern living standards and functional 1 and 2 BHK configurations. Connectivity and Location: Residents frequently highlight the ease of access to the New Link Road, Kandivali Railway Station, and the Dahanukarwadi Metro Station. Community Atmosphere: Reviews often mention a supportive and lively neighborhood, though some find the high population density a bit overwhelming. Construction and Design: The architectural collaboration with European design firms is noted, with users appreciating the natural light and cross-ventilation in the apartments.\n\n![up-thumb](/assets/icons/up-thumb.svg)\n\n### The good things\n\nStrategic Connectivity\n\nThe building is located within 2 kilometers of the Kandivali railway station and near major arterial roads like the Link Road.\n\nEssential Proximity\n\nSchools such as Swami Vivekanand International and hospitals like Lotus Multispeciality are within walking distance or a short drive.\n\nModern Amenities\n\nFacilities including high-speed elevators, power backup, and 24/7 security surveillance are well-received by occupants.\n\nVentilation and Light\n\nApartments are designed to maximize natural sunlight and airflow, reducing the need for artificial lighting during the day.\n\nCommunity Environment\n\nThe locality is described as family-friendly with a strong sense of community and celebration of local festivals.\n\n![down-thumb](/assets/icons/down-thumb.svg)\n\n### Needs improvement\n\nTraffic Congestion\n\nThe surrounding roads, particularly during peak hours, are prone to heavy traffic and bottlenecking.\n\nNoise Pollution\n\nBeing in a bustling part of Kandivali West, residents often experience high noise levels from nearby commercial activities and traffic.\n\nParking Constraints\n\nAvailable parking space is limited, particularly for visitors, which can be a recurring issue for residents.\n\nConstruction Disturbance\n\nOngoing infrastructure and nearby residential projects have occasionally led to dust and noise in the vicinity.\n\nHigh Density\n\nThe increasing number of residential towers in the immediate area has led to a crowded feel and pressure on local resources.\n\n---\n\nThe Verdict\n\nIdeal for nuclear families\n\nExcellent for commuters\n\nHigh convenience factor\n\nPotentially noisy environment\n\nStrong investment potential\n\n## Amenities\n\n![amenities/cctv-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/cctv-secondary.svg)\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\n![amenities/clinic-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/clinic-secondary.svg)\n\nHome Automation\n\n![amenities/indoor-games-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/indoor-games-secondary.svg)\n\nIndoor Games\n\n![amenities/jogging-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-secondary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary.svg)\n\nKids Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\n![amenities/large-green-area-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/large-green-area-secondary.svg)\n\nLarge Green Area\n\n![amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-secondary.svg)\n\nSenior citizen Area\n\n![amenities/walking-area-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/walking-area-secondary.svg)\n\nWalking Area\n\n![amenities/yoga-areas-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/yoga-areas-secondary.svg)\n\nYoga Area\n\n![amenities/cctv-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/cctv-primary.svg)\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\n![amenities/clinic-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/clinic-primary.svg)\n\nHome Automation\n\n![amenities/indoor-games-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/indoor-games-primary.svg)\n\nIndoor Games\n\n![amenities/jogging-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-primary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![amenities/kids-play-areas-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-primary.svg)\n\nKids Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\n![amenities/large-green-area-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/large-green-area-primary.svg)\n\nLarge Green Area\n\n