in its development.\n\nScan this RERA QR code to find out more or search ID here - <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in>\n\n![]()[P51800001136](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=P51800001136)\n\nNeelyog Aashiyana\n\n![]()[P51800034106](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=P51800034106)\n\nNeelyog Aashiyana II\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n### When is the possession date for Neelyog Aashiyana?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nPossession date of Neelyog Aashiyana is 30 Jun 2026\n\n### What is the RERA carpet area range of Neelyog Aashiyana?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe RERA carpet area range for Neelyog Aashiyana is 375 - 683 sqft\n\n### What is the price range of Neelyog Aashiyana?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe price range of Neelyog Aashiyana is ₹73.5 Lacs - 1.34 Cr\n\n### Where is Neelyog Aashiyana located?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nNeelyog Aashiyana is located at Neelyog Aashiyana, Sunder Pada, Tank Lane, Kandivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400067.\n\n### What configurations are available in Neelyog Aashiyana?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nNeelyog Aashiyana has 1 BHK, 2 BHK configurations.\n\n### What is the status of Neelyog Aashiyana?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe status of Neelyog Aashiyana is Ready to move.\n\n### Which amenities are provided in Neelyog Aashiyana?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe amenities are CCTV / Video Surveillance, Home Automation, Indoor Games, Jogging / Cycle Track, Kids Play Areas / Sand Pits, Large Green Area, Senior citizen Area, Walking Area, Yoga Area.\n\n### Who is the developer of Neelyog Aashiyana?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe developer of Neelyog Aashiyana is Neelyog Group.\n\n## About The Developer\n\n![Developer for Neelyog Aashiyana:Neelyog Group](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/120522061017-NewProject(25).png)\n\n## Neelyog Group\n\nNEELYOG GROUP of companies have been engaged in development of residential and commercial properties in the city of Mumbai for more than 2 decades. Neelyog is one of the pioneers of Slum Rehabilitation Scheme in Mumbai. One of the first SRA (slum rehabilitation) project of the city was flagged off by us in Pant Nagar, Ghatkopar and ever since, there has been no looking back. We have since developed more than 5000 slum tenements and handed it over to the slum dwellers free of cost. In the process we have helped realize dreams of thousands of families who are now availing a better standard of living.\n\n## Properties In The Same Area\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/je-vee-infrastructure-shree-gopaldham-elevation-1762949548.jpg)\n\n![Shree Gopaldham](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/240522105543-jeeandvee.png)\n\nShree Gopaldham\n\nKandivali West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹3.45 Cr - 5.64 Cr\n\n3, 4 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/rudra-amar-group-shivani-rudram-elevation-1755173792.jpg)\n\n![Shivani Rudram](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/260525085623-newproject-2025-05-26t205415973.webp)\n\nShivani Rudram\n\nKandivali West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹1.08 Cr - 2.34 Cr\n\n1, 2 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/ambit-builders-and-developers-ambit-primoris-elevation-1743572617.webp)\n\n![Ambit Primoris](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/300923111153-newproject-2023-09-30t111141705.webp)\n\nAmbit Primor