mapped rental: 0 · primary status: recorded\n\ni\n\n## Overview\n\nNeelyog Aashiyana is a project that offers well designed apartments that are well connected with all the major points of the city. The project is spread over 0.51 acres and offers 204 units that range from 1BHK to 2BHK. The apartments are well designed and offer a spacious living area with a well-equipped kitchen. The project is conveniently located in the Mumbai Western Suburbs and is well connected with all the major points of the city. The apartments are also well connected to New Link Road, which makes it easy for residents to commute to work. The project has a convenient shopping centre that offers a range of amenities for residents.\n\n₹\n\n## Price vs Locality\n\n/sqft · locality avg **₹37,500**\n\n49% below avg\n\n₹\n\n## Kandivali West — resale, rent & yield\n\nResale\n\n₹25,373/sqft\n\nmedian · 34 listings\n\nRent\n\n₹75.8/sqft/mo\n\n2 BHK ~₹60,000/mo\n\nGross yield\n\n3.6%/yr\n\nrent vs resale value\n\nThis project is quoted around **₹18,997/sqft** — **25% below** resale here.\n\nFrom MPE live listings, last 18 months · [Mumbai price index ›](/mumbai-property-price-index)\n\n01\n\n## Possession Timeline\n\nProposed\n\nJun 2026\n\nStatus\n\nNew\n\n02\n\n## Unit Configurations (per MahaRERA)\n\nConfigurationCarpetIndicative Price\n\nShop71–134 ft²₹13 L–₹25 L\n\n1 BHK358–390 ft²₹68 L–₹74 L\n\nConfigurations & carpet per MahaRERA filing · indicative price = locality rate × carpet (not the developer's quote).\n\n[💬 Verify current inventory with an advisor](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=I%20am%20looking%20to%20buy%20a%20home%20in%20Project%20Neelyog%20Aashiyana%20Ii%20(RERA%20P51800034106))\n\n03\n\n## RERA Trust Record\n\nMahaRERA No.\n\nP51800034106\n\nRegistered\n\n2022-03-24\n\nLitigation\n\nNo reported in source\n\nEscrow Bank\n\nICICI BANK LIMITED\n\nArchitect\n\nSandip W Tandel\n\nTotal FSI\n\n2517\n\n04\n\n## Buildings · 1 Wing(s)\n\nNeelyog Aashiyana Ii22 floors · — units\n\n05\n\n## 